</p><p data-structure="Precedent" id="p_53"><span class="citetext" data-sentiment="Pos" data-docid="1961694" id="span_18">23.              <a href="/doc/1961694/" id="a_38">Union   of   India  Vs.  Rallia   Ram</a>  reported   in   AIR  1963  SC   1685 


