</p><p data-structure="Precedent" id="p_55">24.             <span class="citetext" data-sentiment="Pos" data-docid="823952" id="span_21">In <a href="/doc/823952/" id="a_42">Union of India Vs. Watkins Mayor and Co.</a> reported in [AIR 


