<p data-structure="Precedent" id="p_57"><span class="citetext" data-sentiment="Pos" data-docid="1961694" id="span_24">It also referred to the judgment and ratio in  <a href="/doc/1961694/" id="a_44">Union of India Vs. Rallia Ram</a> 


